<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Read how Percentage Increase Calculator handles calculator inputs, local browser calculations, logs, cookies, and third-party services.">
  <header class="page-head wrap"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>A plain-language description of the site’s current data handling.</p></header>
  <section class="content-page"><div class="content-grid wrap"><article class="prose">
    <h2>Calculator inputs</h2>
    <p>Values entered into the calculator are processed in your browser. The calculator does not submit those values to a server or save them in a database.</p>
    <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
    <p>No analytics or advertising service is included in the current site build. If either is added later, this policy must be updated before the service is enabled.</p>
    <h2>Hosting logs</h2>
    <p>The future hosting provider may process routine technical information such as IP addresses, requested pages, browser information, and timestamps for security and service operation. The exact provider and its policy will be identified before production launch.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
    <p>The site does not set its own cookies. It saves only your light or dark theme preference in local storage. Calculator values and results are not saved.</p>
    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>Links to other websites are governed by those sites’ privacy practices. Review their policies before sharing personal information.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:nikitasen126@gmail.com">nikitasen126@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </article><aside class="side-index"><strong>Site information</strong><a href="/about/">About</a><a href="/methodology/">Methodology</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></aside></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
